<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"
        xml:lang="en"
        xmlns:tal="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/tal"
        xmlns:metal="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/metal"
        metal:use-macro="backend"
        i18n:domain="c3smembership">
    <tal:block metal:fill-slot="content">
        <h1>Data protection: retention review</h1>
        <p>
            The following datasets have passed their retention period and
            are to be anonymized (Art. 17, Art. 5(1)(e) DSGVO).
            Anonymization clears all personal data but keeps the statutory
            ledger data (membership number, shares, dues). It cannot be
            undone. Archived invoice PDFs of the dataset are deleted.
        </p>
        <form method="post"
                id="anonymization_form"
                action="${request.route_url('data_protection')}">
            <input type="hidden"
                    id="anonymization_confirmed"
                    name="anonymization_confirmed"
                    value="0"/>

            <h2>Former members past retention
                (${python: len(lost_members)})</h2>
            <p>
                Members whose membership loss lies past the retention
                period of ${member_retention_years} years counted from the
                end of the year of the loss (HGB §257, AO §147), i.e.
                membership lost before
                ${python: member_retention_cutoff.strftime('%d.%m.%Y')}.
            </p>
            <p tal:condition="not lost_members">
                <em>No former members past retention.</em>
            </p>
            <table class="table table-striped"
                    tal:condition="lost_members">
                <tr>
                    <th>
                        <input type="checkbox"
                                class="select-all"
                                title="Select all"/>
                    </th>
                    <th>Membership number</th>
                    <th>Lastname</th>
                    <th>Firstname</th>
                    <th>Membership lost</th>
                    <th>Loss type</th>
                </tr>
                <tr tal:repeat="member lost_members">
                    <td>
                        <input type="checkbox"
                                name="member_id"
                                value="${member.id}"/>
                    </td>
                    <td>${member.membership_number}</td>
                    <td>
                        <a href="${request.route_url('detail', member_id=member.id)}">
                            ${member.lastname}
                        </a>
                    </td>
                    <td>${member.firstname}</td>
                    <td>${member.membership_loss_date.strftime('%d.%m.%Y')}</td>
                    <td>${member.membership_loss_type}</td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <h2>Stale membership applications
                (${python: len(stale_applications)})</h2>
            <p>
                Applications which never completed the membership
                acquisition process and were submitted more than
                ${application_retention_months} months ago, i.e. before
                ${python: application_retention_cutoff.strftime('%d.%m.%Y')}.
                There is no legal basis to keep them longer
                (Art. 5(1)(e) DSGVO). Duplicates are included.
            </p>
            <p tal:condition="not stale_applications">
                <em>No stale membership applications.</em>
            </p>
            <table class="table table-striped"
                    tal:condition="stale_applications">
                <tr>
                    <th>
                        <input type="checkbox"
                                class="select-all"
                                title="Select all"/>
                    </th>
                    <th>ID</th>
                    <th>Lastname</th>
                    <th>Firstname</th>
                    <th>Email</th>
                    <th>Submitted</th>
                    <th>Duplicate</th>
                </tr>
                <tr tal:repeat="member stale_applications">
                    <td>
                        <input type="checkbox"
                                name="member_id"
                                value="${member.id}"/>
                    </td>
                    <td>${member.id}</td>
                    <td>
                        <a href="${request.route_url('detail', member_id=member.id)}">
                            ${member.lastname}
                        </a>
                    </td>
                    <td>${member.firstname}</td>
                    <td>${member.email}</td>
                    <td>${member.date_of_submission.strftime('%d.%m.%Y')}</td>
                    <td>
                        <i tal:condition="member.is_duplicate"
                                class="fas fa-check"
                                title="Duplicate of id ${member.is_duplicate_of}">
                        </i>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <button type="submit"
                    class="btn btn-danger"
                    tal:condition="lost_members or stale_applications">
                Anonymize selected datasets
            </button>
        </form>
    </tal:block>
    <tal:block metal:fill-slot="javascript">
        <script type="text/javascript">
            $().ready(function() {
                $(".select-all").click(function() {
                    $(this).closest("table")
                        .find("input[name='member_id']")
                        .prop("checked", $(this).prop("checked"));
                });
                $("#anonymization_form").submit(function(event) {
                    var count = $(this)
                        .find("input[name='member_id']:checked").length;
                    if (count === 0) {
                        alert("No datasets selected.");
                        event.preventDefault();
                        return;
                    }
                    var answer = confirm(
                        "Anonymize " + count + " dataset(s)? " +
                        "All personal data will be erased irreversibly.");
                    if (answer) {
                        $("#anonymization_confirmed").val("1");
                    } else {
                        event.preventDefault();
                    }
                });
            });
        </script>
    </tal:block>
</html>
